{
    "title": "Hyper Touchdown 3D",
    "description": "Hey football lover! Are you ready for the best American Football Game ever? You should be because this game is tailored for only the real gourmets of football! The football season is already streaming but is only watching enough for you? It is time to take some action with the Hyper Touchdown 3D! Did you memorize the whole team members? All touchdown legends are here and they are waiting for you to live this amazing feeling with them. If you would like to be one of them - a real legend- here is the chance for you! Choose your player and start some kicking and throwing and dodging! Reach to the top. American football season can be only for a period but in this game, you have the season whenever you like! Build up your dream team and start to crash others! By the way, if you can match the balls and collect the trophies, amazing rewards are waiting for you! While collecting these and upgrading your team, you will smash all opponents! Just be a consistent and decisive player and no one can stand\r\nagainst you. Besides all, there are special gamer card decks and special rewards. Put your game face on and get ready to be the best captain ever!",
